{#
  BeMart Password-reset-request page — EC-CUBE goRequestPasswordReset.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Forgot/index.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Forgot/index.twig).

  Markup skeleton, `ec-role` / `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-forgotRole` /
  `ec-off1Grid` / `ec-forgotRole__form` / `ec-forgotRole__intro` /
  `ec-borderedDefs` / `ec-input` / `ec-off4Grid` classes + the
  <dl>/<dt>/<dd> definition-list structure are kept verbatim from
  EC-CUBE.

  Phase 3 — FORM page (Ray.WebFormModule). The ForgotPassword resource
  exposes a real `ForgotForm` (an AbstractForm) as `body.form`; the
  single email input is rendered through it:

    {{ form.input('email')|raw }}   <- real <input> w/ name/attrs
    {{ form.error('email') }}        <- inline Be-domain error

  EC-CUBE renders the same input through the Symfony FormView
  (`form_widget(form.email)`); the render-diff test stubs EC-CUBE's
  `form_widget` to delegate to the SAME ForgotForm, so the input diffs
  to ZERO. Validation authority stays with the Be Framework Becoming
  chain (RequestPasswordResetInput Semantics).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `form._token` — Symfony CSRF widget; kept as a hidden input with an
     empty value (BeMart's html context has no CSRF widget).
   - `form_label` / `form_errors` — Symfony FormView; the label is
     authored plainly, the inline error renders via `form.error(...)`.
   - `has_errors(...)` — request-validation runtime; false on a fresh
     form, so the conditional ` error` class never appears.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'other_page' %}
{% set route = 'forgot-password' %}
{% set title = 'パスワードの再発行' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-role">
        <div class="ec-pageHeader">
            <h1>パスワードの再発行</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ec-forgotRole">
        <form name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="/forgot-password">
            <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
            <div class="ec-off1Grid">
                <div class="ec-off1Grid__cell">
                    <div class="ec-forgotRole__form">
                        <div class="ec-forgotRole__intro">
                            <p class="ec-para-normal">ご登録時のメールアドレスを入力して「次へ」ボタンをクリックしてください。</p>
                            <p class="ec-para-normal">※パスワード再発行メールを送信します。メールの内容をご確認の上、新しいパスワードを登録してください。</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ec-borderedDefs">
                            <dl>
                                <dt>
                                    <label class="ec-label">メールアドレス</label>
                                </dt>
                                <dd>
                                    <div class="ec-input">
                                        {{ form.input('email')|raw }}
                                        {{ form.error('email') }}
                                    </div>
                                </dd>
                            </dl>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ec-off4Grid">
                <div class="ec-off4Grid__cell">
                    <button type="submit" class="ec-blockBtn--action">次へ</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
